\import{fnip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fnip}
\taxon{Example}
\title{The Hodgkin–Huxley pair}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{\citet{p. 63}{ermentrout2010mathematical} records a Hopf
bifurcation of the space-clamped Hodgkin–Huxley equations
near #{I_{\mathrm{app}}\approx 10} and another near
#{I_{\mathrm{app}}\approx 154}. The frequency runs from
about #{40} Hz to about #{150} Hz.}

\p{\citet{p. 64}{ermentrout2010mathematical} records that the
lower bifurcation is subcritical and the upper one is
supercritical. The invariant formula gives a positive
coefficient at the lower point and a negative coefficient at
the upper point.}
